---@field destinationStore? string Required. The name of the DICOM store to write the redacted data to. For example, `projects/{project_id}/locations/{location_id}/datasets/{dataset_id}/dicomStores/{dicom_store_id}`. * The destination dataset and DICOM store must exist. * The source dataset and destination dataset must both reside in the same location. De-identifying data across multiple locations is not supported. * The caller must have the healthcare.dicomStores.dicomWebWrite permission to write to the destination DICOM store.
